    "message": "Check that four interventions change what operators see\n\nEach test forks the UI-generated Scenario, applies one approved\nEffectProgram, advances both Branches with the TickEngine and compares the\nProject screen KPIs, while also checking the recorded events behind the\nchange: added staff, a toilet outage, a water outage and a water delivery.\nconftest can now build the same preview with some form fields changed, for\na four-day Scenario (water outage needs it, #65) or entered stock.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
